      "id": "claim_b3d986c7570e493cbbd335c976304c8c",
      "statement": "The EventBus is a heap-free FreeRTOS-queue publish/subscribe bus with 16 handlers and a default queue depth of 32, and plugin EVENT_* bits are statically asserted to match the core EventType masks.",
